ep in diagnosing the application's issues. So the tool call should be to exec_read_only_kubectl_cmd with the command 'kubectl get pods -n astronomy-shop'.\n</think>\n\n", additional_kwargs={'tool_calls': [{'function': {'arguments': '{"command": "kubectl get pods -n astronomy-shop"}', 'name': 'exec_read_only_kubectl_cmd'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-a0f7d17fcff50144', 'type': 'function'}], 'provider_specific_fields': {'refusal': None, 'reasoning': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 294, 'prompt_tokens': 2716, 'total_tokens': 3010, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfc11-0856-7023-a7d5-aa655df0dda1-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'exec_read_only_kubectl_cmd', 'args': {'command': 'kubectl get pods -n astronomy-shop'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-a0f7d17fcff50144', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 2716, 'output_tokens': 294, 'total_tokens': 3010}), ToolMessage(content='NAME                               READY   STATUS    RESTARTS       AGE\naccounting-844d99ddff-g8hgs        1/1     Running   0              2m36s\nad-6f9964ffd8-h7vpl                1/1     Running   0              2m37s\ncart-65474cd577-nsn5v              1/1     Running   0              2m38s\ncheckout-648b497649-m54vg          1/1     Running   0              2m36s\ncurrency-69f5b55bbc-tvvkh          1/1     Running   0              2m37s\nemail-56985bb4f8-nqxvq             1/1     Running   0              2m37s\nflagd-79c4c6cb44-b8gnv             2/2     Running   0              2m35s\nfraud-detection-88b76487c-hmznb    1/1     Running   0              2m37s\nfrontend-55df67b4b9-k9rmj          1/1     Running   1 (11s ago)    34s\nfrontend-proxy-84788b44b-hjp8s     1/1     Running   0              2m35s\ngrafana-bdbfb995f-ch474            4/4     Running   0              2m35s\nima