nConditions:\n  Type                        Status\n  PodReadyToStartContainers   True \n  Initialized                 True \n  Ready                       False \n  ContainersReady             False \n  PodScheduled                True \nVolumes:\n  kube-api-access-98x7f:\n    Type:                    Projected (a volume that contains injected data from multiple sources)\n    TokenExpirationSeconds:  3607\n    ConfigMapName:           kube-root-ca.crt\n    Optional:                false\n    DownwardAPI:             true\nQoS Class:                   Burstable\nNode-Selectors:              <none>\nTolerations:                 node.kubernetes.io/not-ready:NoExecute op=Exists for 300s\n                             node.kubernetes.io/unreachable:NoExecute op=Exists for 300s\nEvents:\n  Type     Reason     Age                 From               Message\n  ----     ------     ----                ----               -------\n  Normal   Scheduled  116s                default-scheduler  Successfully assigned astronomy-shop/frontend-55df67b4b9-k9rmj to node1.htliang2-agent.insai-pg0.apt.emulab.net\n  Normal   Pulled     34s (x5 over 113s)  kubelet            spec.containers{frontend}: Container image "ghcr.io/open-telemetry/demo:2.2.0-frontend" already present on machine\n  Normal   Created    33s (x5 over 111s)  kubelet            spec.containers{frontend}: Created container: frontend\n  Normal   Started    33s (x5 over 111s)  kubelet            spec.containers{frontend}: Started container frontend\n  Warning  Unhealthy  15s (x5 over 95s)   kubelet            spec.containers{frontend}: Liveness probe failed: HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 404\n  Normal   Killing    15s (x5 over 95s)   kubelet            spec.containers{frontend}: Container frontend failed liveness probe, will be restarted\n', id='21071f3d-c2ee-4089-b1e1-93029f8e2bae', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-bc47db1ea2978ab0'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available